{"id":"2a6ae68f45ba9960","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-three-valued-satisfaction.md","title":"三值满足关系","display":"df-three-valued-satisfaction — 三值满足关系","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-three-valued-satisfaction","aliases":["91-df-three-valued-satisfaction","91-df-3-valued-satisfaction","91-df-satisfaction-three-valued"],"display":"df-three-valued-satisfaction — 三值满足关系","depends_on":["[[91-df-partial-logic]]","[[91-df-ground-model]]","[[91-df-strong-kleene]]","[[91-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-three-valued-satisfaction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-three-valued-satisfaction</span><span>91-df-3-valued-satisfaction</span><span>91-df-satisfaction-three-valued</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-three-valued-satisfaction — 三值满足关系"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0d412b656b2bbda0\" href=\"?note=0d412b656b2bbda0\" title=\"91-df-partial-logic\">91-df-partial-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"253f996295270684\" href=\"?note=253f996295270684\" title=\"91-df-ground-model\">91-df-ground-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fcfe6f023ac58abf\" href=\"?note=fcfe6f023ac58abf\" title=\"91-df-strong-kleene\">91-df-strong-kleene</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-three-valued-satisfaction-—-三值满足关系-$\\vDash_3$\">df-three-valued-satisfaction — 三值满足关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vDash_3\">\\(\\vDash_3\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N\">\\(\\mathcal N\\)</span> (论域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 的标准基础语言模型)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf 3=\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\">\\(\\mathbf 3=\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\\)</span> (三值)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtSent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{AtSent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> (基础语言原子句集合)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma=(\\Gamma^+,\\Gamma^-)\">\\(\\Gamma=(\\Gamma^+,\\Gamma^-)\\)</span>，其中\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma^+,\\Gamma^-\\subseteq\n\\{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner\\mid\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\}\">\\(\\Gamma^+,\\Gamma^-\\subseteq\n\\{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner\\mid\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\}\\)</span>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma^+\\cap\\Gamma^-=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Gamma^+\\cap\\Gamma^-=\\varnothing\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SK}_3\">\\(\\mathrm{SK}_3\\)</span> (强 Kleene 递归子句, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fcfe6f023ac58abf\" href=\"?note=fcfe6f023ac58abf\" title=\"91-df-strong-kleene\">91-df-strong-kleene</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathcal N,\\Gamma}_3:\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\mathbf 3\">\\(\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathcal N,\\Gamma}_3:\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\mathbf 3\\)</span> 为满足以下条件的唯一递归评估：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{SK}_3(\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathcal N,\\Gamma}_3),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtSent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\quad\n\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathcal N,\\Gamma}_3(\\alpha)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathbf t&amp;\\mathcal N\\models\\alpha,\\\\\n\\mathbf f&amp;\\mathcal N\\not\\models\\alpha,\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n&amp;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathcal N,\\Gamma}_3(T(\\overline n))=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathbf t&amp;n\\in\\Gamma^+,\\\\\n\\mathbf f&amp;n\\in\\Gamma^-,\\\\\n\\mathbf u&amp;n\\notin\\Gamma^+\\cup\\Gamma^-.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{SK}_3(\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathcal N,\\Gamma}_3),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtSent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\quad\n\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathcal N,\\Gamma}_3(\\alpha)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathbf t&amp;\\mathcal N\\models\\alpha,\\\\\n\\mathbf f&amp;\\mathcal N\\not\\models\\alpha,\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n&amp;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathcal N,\\Gamma}_3(T(\\overline n))=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathbf t&amp;n\\in\\Gamma^+,\\\\\n\\mathbf f&amp;n\\in\\Gamma^-,\\\\\n\\mathbf u&amp;n\\notin\\Gamma^+\\cup\\Gamma^-.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>于是</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}three\\text{-}valued\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash\n(\\mathcal N,\\Gamma)\\vDash_3\\varphi\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathcal N,\\Gamma}_3(\\varphi)=\\mathbf t.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}three\\text{-}valued\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash\n(\\mathcal N,\\Gamma)\\vDash_3\\varphi\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathcal N,\\Gamma}_3(\\varphi)=\\mathbf t.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vDash_3\">\\(\\vDash_3\\)</span> : 三值满足关系</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma^+,\\Gamma^-\">\\(\\Gamma^+,\\Gamma^-\\)</span>：分别记录已判真的句子编码与已判假的句子编码</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal N,\\Gamma)\">\\((\\mathcal N,\\Gamma)\\)</span> : 带部分真理解释的标准算术模型</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三值满足的特点：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>非二值</td>\n<td>句子可真、假、或间隙</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>真值依赖<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span></td>\n<td>不同<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>给出不同真值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固定点相关</td>\n<td>固定点使满足关系稳定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>三值满足与经典满足的关系：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vDash_{\\mathrm{CL}} = \\vDash_3 \\upharpoonright \\mathcal{L}_0\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vDash_{\\mathrm{CL}} = \\vDash_3 \\upharpoonright \\mathcal{L}_0\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>只要基础结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\">\\(\\mathcal M\\)</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_0\">\\(\\mathcal L_0\\)</span> 采用经典解释，限制到基础语言后便退化为经典满足。</p>\n<p>三值满足的递归定义：\n对于组合句子：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_3(\\varphi\\land\\psi)\n=\n\\min_{\\mathbf f&lt;\\mathbf u&lt;\\mathbf t}\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{val}_3(\\varphi),\n\\operatorname{val}_3(\\psi)\n\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{val}_3(\\varphi\\land\\psi)\n=\n\\min_{\\mathbf f&lt;\\mathbf u&lt;\\mathbf t}\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{val}_3(\\varphi),\n\\operatorname{val}_3(\\psi)\n\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>（强Kleene解释）</p>\n<p>对于否定：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_3(\\neg\\varphi)\n=\n\\neg_3\\operatorname{val}_3(\\varphi)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{val}_3(\\neg\\varphi)\n=\n\\neg_3\\operatorname{val}_3(\\varphi)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg_3(t) = f\">\\(\\neg_3(t) = f\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg_3(f) = t\">\\(\\neg_3(f) = t\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg_3(u) = u\">\\(\\neg_3(u) = u\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vDash_3\">\\(\\vDash_3\\)</span> 是“真值等于指定值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf t\">\\(\\mathbf t\\)</span>”的关系，不是可以作为\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min\">\\(\\min\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg_3\">\\(\\neg_3\\)</span> 参数的真值对象；递归运算必须作用于\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_3\">\\(\\operatorname{val}_3\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 是固定点”还要求它等于由上述递归评估诱导出的跳跃结果；仅有真理原子式的解释子句并不能推出固定点性。</p>\n<p>三值满足的意义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Kripke 固定点模型与 KF 预期模型的语义基础</li>\n<li>形式化真理间隙的关键概念</li>\n<li>连接语法和语义的桥梁</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-three-valued-satisfaction-—-三值满足关系-$\\vDash_3$","text":"df-three-valued-satisfaction — 三值满足关系 $\\vDash_3$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-partial-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0d412b656b2bbda0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-partial-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-ground-model","status":"resolved","id":"253f996295270684","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-ground-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-strong-kleene","status":"resolved","id":"fcfe6f023ac58abf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-strong-kleene]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"822ef14bbd4e020d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-strong-kleene","status":"resolved","id":"fcfe6f023ac58abf","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SK}_3$ (强 Kleene 递归子句, see [[91-df-strong-kleene]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\vDash_3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf 3=\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AtSent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma=(\\Gamma^+,\\Gamma^-)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma^+,\\Gamma^-\\subseteq\n\\{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner\\mid\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma^+\\cap\\Gamma^-=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SK}_3","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathcal N,\\Gamma}_3:\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\mathbf 3","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{SK}_3(\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathcal N,\\Gamma}_3),\\\\\n&\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtSent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\quad\n\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathcal N,\\Gamma}_3(\\alpha)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathbf t&\\mathcal N\\models\\alpha,\\\\\n\\mathbf f&\\mathcal N\\not\\models\\alpha,\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n&\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathcal N,\\Gamma}_3(T(\\overline n))=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathbf t&n\\in\\Gamma^+,\\\\\n\\mathbf f&n\\in\\Gamma^-,\\\\\n\\mathbf u&n\\notin\\Gamma^+\\cup\\Gamma^-.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}three\\text{-}valued\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash\n(\\mathcal N,\\Gamma)\\vDash_3\\varphi\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathcal N,\\Gamma}_3(\\varphi)=\\mathbf t.","display":true},{"tex":"\\vDash_3","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma^+,\\Gamma^-","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathcal N,\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\vDash_{\\mathrm{CL}} = \\vDash_3 \\upharpoonright \\mathcal{L}_0","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}_3(\\varphi\\land\\psi)\n=\n\\min_{\\mathbf f<\\mathbf u<\\mathbf t}\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{val}_3(\\varphi),\n\\operatorname{val}_3(\\psi)\n\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}_3(\\neg\\varphi)\n=\n\\neg_3\\operatorname{val}_3(\\varphi)","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg_3(t) = f","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg_3(f) = t","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg_3(u) = u","display":false},{"tex":"\\vDash_3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf t","display":false},{"tex":"\\min","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg_3","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}_3","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false}],"bytes":3394,"backlinks":[{"id":"0d8969c7b834f5a6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8747011468390705","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$(\\mathcal N,\\Gamma)$ (三值模型, see [[91-df-three-valued-satisfaction]])"},{"id":"8adbccc4211045f3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-43","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-three-valued-satisfaction]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-86","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extensi